msgctxt "#30283"
msgid "Used by the context menu entry \"Stream transcoded\" on a recording: EPGStation re-encodes the recording as HLS in one of the recorded-stream modes of its config.yml (stream.recorded.ts.hls / stream.recorded.encoded.hls), first or last in that list, or you pick one each time. It loads the server's CPU and keeps the encoded segments of the rest of the recording in its data/streamfiles until playback stops (about 1.5 to 3 GB per hour). Seeking works only within the part already encoded, and only with inputstream.adaptive installed."
msgstr "録画の右クリックメニュー「変換して再生」で使います。EPGStation が録画を config.yml の録画配信モード (stream.recorded.ts.hls / stream.recorded.encoded.hls) の1番目または最後、または毎回選んだモードで HLS に再エンコードします。サーバーの CPU に負荷がかかり、再生を止めるまで録画の残り部分の変換済みファイルがサーバーの data/streamfiles にたまります (1時間あたり約1.5〜3GB)。シークは変換済みの範囲内だけで、inputstream.adaptive が必要です。"

